饰与动态：\n服装：“绯红丝绸汉服（crimson silk hanfu）+ 金线刺绣（embroidered with gold thread）+ 薄纱红袖（sheer red sleeves）”兼顾传统形制与飘逸质感；\n尾巴：“蓬松九条红尾（Nine fluffy red tails）”是九尾狐核心符号，需强调“扇形展开（fan out）”的视觉张力。\n环境与氛围：\n背景层次：“满月（full moon）+ 樱花枝/落瓣（cherry blossom branches with falling petals）+ 水面灯笼（glowing lantern on rippling water）”构建“月夜、花海、水境”的东方意境；\n卷轴细节：“做旧边缘（weathered edges）+ 书法/印章（traditional Chinese calligraphy and red seal stamp）”锚定古风载体，增强故事性。\n艺术与光影：\n风格参考：“guweiz（空灵写实）+ wlop（精细线条）”双艺术家风格融合，确保画面既梦幻又具细节精度；\n光影特效：“柔和体积光（soft volumetric lighting）+ 梦幻散景（dreamy bokeh effects）”营造朦胧仙气，“高饱和色彩分级（rich color grading）”强化红、金、蓝的视觉冲击；\n技术参数：“8k分辨率（8k resolution）+ 超高清细节（ultra - high detail）”保障输出质量，“电影级构图（cinematic composition）”提升叙事感。"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 5, "label": "CLIP", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "文本"}], "flags": {}, "id": 3, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode"}, "order": 4}], "extra": {"links_added_by_ue": [], "ue_links": [], "0246.VERSION": [0, 0, 4], "ds": {"offset": [526.4248647769772, -12.833408160085531], "scale": 0.8769226950000011}}, "groups": [{"color": "#3f789e", "font_size": 24, "flags": {}, "id": 1, "title": "系统学习comfyui工作流，联系微信：1142817564（添加备注来意）", "bounding": [-402.7281188964844, 151.31524658203125, 1247.10205078125, 505.8263854980469]}], "links": [[1, 2, 0, 1, 0, "MODEL"], [2, 3, 0, 1, 1, "CONDITIONING"], [3, 4, 0, 1, 2, "CONDITIONING"], [4, 3, 0, 4, 0, "CONDITIONING"], [5, 5, 0, 3, 0, "CLIP"], [6, 1, 0, 6, 0, "LATENT"], [7, 6, 0, 7, 0, "IMAGE"], [8, 8, 0, 6, 1, "VAE"], [9, 9, 0, 1, 3, "LATENT"]], "id": "4ad39452-f777-486b-b7f7-43cf41859d6c", "config": {}, "version": 0.4, "last_node_id": 9, "revision": 0}